      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rapid_City%2C_South_Dakota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Rapid City’s downtown hosts a city‑wide tour of life‑size bronze statues of U.S. presidents, a quirky cultural landmark.",
